    "summary": "Each battle round, the Phobos Captain’s unit can make one of these moves. If it shoots in your Shooting phase and is Unengaged, it can move up to D6″ with a Normal Move. If Engaged when the opposing Fight phase closes, it can use a Fall-Back Move to travel up to 6″.",
